# Data Cache
# A minimal seed cache (16 tickers' newest parquet + the 3 model artifacts + manifest.json)
# is committed under data/.cache_seed/ so a fresh clone can bootstrap without a 17yr
# network refresh or a full evolve retrain. See CLAUDE.md "Bootstrapping a new session".
data/.cache/
*.parquet
*.pkl
*.pickle
!data/.cache_seed/
!data/.cache_seed/**

